&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Purpose&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SentinelOne, we are driven by a clear purpose: to give the advantage to those who secure our future. As AI reshapes how organizations build, operate, and innovate, the responsibility to protect them becomes more critical than ever. When you join SentinelOne, your work helps protect global enterprises, critical infrastructure, and the technologies shaping tomorrow. If you are motivated by meaningful challenges and want your impact to be real, measurable, and global, you will find purpose here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SentinelOne is a company at the intersection of AI and security, pioneering a new operating model for cybersecurity. Our AI-native platform unifies protection across endpoint, cloud, identity, data, and AI systems to deliver autonomous detection and response with clarity and speed. By combining real-time analytics, intelligent automation, and a unified data foundation, we reduce noise, simplify complexity, and empower security teams to focus on what truly matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams are builders, problem-solvers, and innovators committed to shaping the future of security. If you are excited to solve hard problems alongside talented, mission-driven people, we invite you to help us build a safer future for humanity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Are We Looking For?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for people who are relentlessly curious and committed to continuous learning. AI is reshaping every function across our business, and we enable every team member, regardless of role or level, to build fluency in AI tools and concepts. Those who thrive here actively seek out new solutions, experiment thoughtfully, and apply what they learn to drive better, faster, smarter outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Sales Operations Manager, you will support the EMEA South Go-To-Market team as a trusted advisor to sales leaders, enabling consistent, predictable, and repeatable hyper-growth through sales discipline, streamlined processes, and a strong operating cadence. You will partner with the EMEA South Leadership Team on GTM design, business analysis, and metrics while managing the day-to-day rhythm of the business, with field productivity as your north star. This role is based in Amsterdam, Prague, or Milan, and is ideal for someone who wants to be an active voice driving change rather than a passive spectator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Will You Do?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Primary responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the EMEA South Operations Lead and trusted advisor to key sales leaders, actively participating in the EMEA forecasting process, advising on changing pipeline dynamics, and challenging forecasts to ensure accuracy, predictability, and transparency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Area business metrics including performance, trends, headcount, and investment models, and lead the development of key sales metrics and business review materials, monitoring performance and taking action to optimize business results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the annual sales planning process, including Area, Regional, and District goal assignments, territory management updates, and sales compensation plan changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify gaps in the infrastructure needed to support Sales and develop solutions, with a strong focus on AI, that align to the team’s overall vision, while educating and training teams on key sales processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an active voice that drives change with Area leadership, and align with the Global Revenue Operations team to represent the needs of the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Skills and Knowledge Will You Bring?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideal candidates will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7 to 10 years of experience in Sales, Revenue, or Field Operations supporting sales teams, with a strong emphasis on enabling teams to be hyper-productive, ideally within organizations selling subscription security software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and scaling processes that support a hyper-growth business model, including documenting key processes in a publicly traded environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven analytical ability to turn disparate datasets into insightful analytics, including developing messaging, data visualizations, and executive-level presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with a key tech stack including Salesforce, Clari, Tableau, MS Office, G-Suite, and AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to influence sales teams, build collaborative relationships across functions, and translate the complex needs of the field. A Bachelor’s degree in Finance, Management, Technology, or Economics is required, and an MBA is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why SentinelOne?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is redefining how the world operates and rewriting the rules of security in real time, and SentinelOne was built for this moment. From day one, we architected an AI-native platform designed to operate at machine speed, not as an add-on to legacy systems but as the foundation itself. If you want to build where innovation and impact move together, this is that place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in our Sentinels with comprehensive, competitive benefits designed to support you and your family:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity &amp;amp; Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restricted Stock Units (RSUs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive leave benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gender-neutral parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insurance &amp;amp; Financial Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insurance and medical allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Perks &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global home office allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile phone reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter or work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Lifestyle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness benefit&lt;/li&gt;
